      138.48,
      376.2,
      450.49,
      386.28
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      388.2,
      530.6,
      410.28
    ],
    "text": "POTTUVIL PRADESHIYA SABHAUNDER SECTION 66 A (1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      424.16,
      469.59,
      434.24
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of member of Pottuvil Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen Vacant by reason of resignation:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      444.56,
      539.95,
      490.64
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the secretary of the Sri Lanka Freedom Party the recognized political party to which KirishnapillaiKirishnaveni the member belonged, was required by me under section 66A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide uponreturned member of Sri Lanka Freedom Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under section 9 of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      499.76,
      540.12,
      521.84
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominateMuhammathismail Kairunnisa to fill such vacancy;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      535.76,
      540.27,
      569.84
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE R. Sasilan, returning Officer of the Pottuvil Pradeshiya Sabha acting in terms of section 66A (1) ofthe Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that Muhammathismail Kairunnisa was selected asthe member of the Pottuvil Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      364.32,
      583.76,
      525.64,
      617.84
    ],
    "text": "R. SASILAN, Returning Officer, Pottuvil Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
